#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to set up custom roles that provide access to a specific set of actions"
msgstr "Cara menyediakan peranan tersuai yang memberikan akses kepada set tindakan tertentu"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up custom roles"
msgstr "Sediakan peranan tersuai"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up custom roles {#set-up-custom-roles}"
msgstr "Sediakan peranan tersuai {#set-up-custom-roles}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When account owners and administrators set up user access for an account, they assign roles (example: Editor, Viewer, Operator, and so on) to [access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups), and then assign users to those policies or groups. A user can perform all the actions mapped to the role or roles that have been assigned to their access group or policy.\n"
msgstr "Apabila pemilik akaun dan pentadbir menyediakan akses pengguna untuk akaun, mereka menugaskan peranan (contoh: Editor, Penonton, Operator, dan sebagainya) kepada [polisi akses dan kumpulan akses](/guides/access-groups), kemudian menugaskan pengguna kepada polisi atau kumpulan tersebut. Pengguna boleh melakukan semua tindakan yang dipetakan kepada peranan atau peranan yang telah ditugaskan kepada kumpulan akses atau polisi mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the pre-configured roles listed on the [Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) page, account owners and administrators can create roles that better match their needs. For example, you can create a custom role that grants a user access to view account usage analytics without granting any other management access. The next section gives a step-by-step demonstration of this example.\n"
msgstr "Selain peranan pra-konfigurasi yang disenaraikan pada halaman [Peranan](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles), pemilik akaun dan pentadbir boleh mencipta peranan yang lebih sesuai dengan keperluan mereka. Contohnya, anda boleh mencipta peranan tersuai yang memberikan pengguna akses untuk melihat analitik penggunaan akaun tanpa memberikan sebarang akses pengurusan lain. Bahagian seterusnya memberikan demonstrasi langkah demi langkah contoh ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"custom\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"custom\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: create a custom role that allows users to perform actions to work with IBM Quantum service instances {#example-create-a-custom-role-that-allows-users-to-perform-actions-to-work-with-ibm-quantum-service-instances}"
msgstr "Contoh: cipta peranan tersuai yang membolehkan pengguna melakukan tindakan untuk bekerja dengan instans perkhidmatan IBM Quantum {#example-create-a-custom-role-that-allows-users-to-perform-actions-to-work-with-ibm-quantum-service-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This custom role grants quantum-specific roles to users.\n"
msgstr "Peranan tersuai ini memberikan peranan khusus kuantum kepada pengguna.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "From [Manage → IAM → Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles), click `Create` (only visible for account administrators).\n"
msgstr "Daripada [Manage → IAM → Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles), klik `Create` (hanya kelihatan untuk pentadbir akaun).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a name, ID, description, and select `Quantum Compute` for the service.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan nama, ID, keterangan, dan pilih `Quantum Compute` untuk perkhidmatan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select the following roles, then click **Create**.\n"
msgstr "Pilih peranan berikut, kemudian klik **Cipta**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.device.read\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.device.read\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.job.cancel\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.job.cancel\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.job.create\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.job.create\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.job.read\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.job.read\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.program.delete\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.program.delete\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.program.read\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.program.read\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "quantum-computing.user.logout\n"
msgstr "quantum-computing.user.logout\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select quantum-computing.job.delete if you want to allow users to delete jobs.\n"
msgstr "Pilih quantum-computing.job.delete jika anda mahu membenarkan pengguna memadam kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: create a custom role for a user to view analytics only {#example-create-a-custom-role-for-a-user-to-view-analytics-only}"
msgstr "Contoh: cipta peranan tersuai untuk pengguna melihat analitik sahaja {#example-create-a-custom-role-for-a-user-to-view-analytics-only}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to [Manage → IAM → Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) in IBM Cloud. Select Quantum Compute from the dropdown menu to see the roles that currently exist for this service.\n"
msgstr "Pergi ke [Urus → IAM → Peranan](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) dalam IBM Cloud. Pilih Quantum Compute dari menu lungsur untuk melihat peranan yang kini wujud untuk perkhidmatan ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the **Create +** button.\n"
msgstr "Klik butang **Cipta +**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a name for the custom role, such as `Analytics Viewer`.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan nama untuk peranan tersuai, seperti `Analytics Viewer`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter an ID. You can input any unique string for this ID, as long as it starts with a capital letter, and contains only alphanumeric characters (no spaces) - for example, `AnalyticsViewer`.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan ID. Anda boleh memasukkan mana-mana rentetan unik untuk ID ini, selagi ia bermula dengan huruf besar, dan hanya mengandungi aksara alfanumerik (tanpa ruang) - contohnya, `AnalyticsViewer`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a description for the custom role. In this example, an appropriate description might be \"As an Analytics Viewer, you can view account analytics only.\"\n"
msgstr "Masukkan keterangan untuk peranan tersuai. Dalam contoh ini, keterangan yang sesuai mungkin \"Sebagai Analytics Viewer, anda boleh melihat analitik akaun sahaja.\"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the Service dropdown menu, choose Quantum Compute. A table appears that contains all the actions that you can map to the role.\n"
msgstr "Dalam menu lungsur Perkhidmatan, pilih Quantum Compute. Jadual akan muncul yang mengandungi semua tindakan yang boleh anda petakan kepada peranan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"7. For this example, look for any actions that pertain to analytics, such as \"Read usage filters for analytics\" and \"Read usage for analytics\". Also include the \"Read account configuration\" action.\n"
"To add the actions to your custom role, click Add at the end of the action's row.\n"
msgstr ""
"7. Untuk contoh ini, cari sebarang tindakan yang berkaitan dengan analitik, seperti \"Baca penapis penggunaan untuk analitik\" dan \"Baca penggunaan untuk analitik\". Juga sertakan tindakan \"Baca konfigurasi akaun\".\n"
"Untuk menambah tindakan kepada peranan tersuai anda, klik Tambah di hujung baris tindakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '8. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have added all the actions you want mapped to the role, click Create.\n"
msgstr "Setelah anda menambah semua tindakan yang anda mahu dipetakan kepada peranan, klik Cipta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '9. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to [Manage → IAM → Access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). Click **Create +** to create a new access role. (It is recommended to create a new access group especially for this role, rather than add the role to your Public Access group, unless you want all your users to have the access granted by your custom role.) Once you have clicked **Create +** and named your new group (or, in the case of editing an existing access group, once you have clicked the name of the access group to edit), then click the Access tab. Click **Assign access +**.\n"
msgstr "Pergi ke [Urus → IAM → Kumpulan akses](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). Klik **Cipta +** untuk mencipta kumpulan akses baharu. (Adalah disyorkan untuk mencipta kumpulan akses baharu khusus untuk peranan ini, dan bukannya menambah peranan kepada kumpulan Akses Awam anda, melainkan anda mahu semua pengguna anda mempunyai akses yang diberikan oleh peranan tersuai anda.) Setelah anda mengklik **Cipta +** dan menamakan kumpulan baharu anda (atau, dalam kes mengedit kumpulan akses sedia ada, setelah anda mengklik nama kumpulan akses untuk diedit), kemudian klik tab Akses. Klik **Tugaskan akses +**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '10. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Under Service, select Quantum Compute, then click Next.\n"
msgstr "Di bawah Perkhidmatan, pilih Quantum Compute, kemudian klik Seterusnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '11. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Under Resources, select All resources, then click Next. (Note that if you do not scope the access to all resources, the Analytics Viewer role will not be able to see analytics from all instances.)\n"
msgstr "Di bawah Sumber, pilih Semua sumber, kemudian klik Seterusnya. (Perlu diingat bahawa jika anda tidak menghadkan akses kepada semua sumber, peranan Analytics Viewer tidak akan dapat melihat analitik daripada semua instans.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '12. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Under Roles and actions, check the Viewer box (under Platform) and the Analytics Viewer box (under Custom access), then click Next.\n"
msgstr "Di bawah Peranan dan tindakan, tandakan kotak Penonton (di bawah Platform) dan kotak Analytics Viewer (di bawah Akses tersuai), kemudian klik Seterusnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '13. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Add >**, then click Assign. You have now created a policy that includes your custom role as well as the Viewer role.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Tambah >**, kemudian klik Tugaskan. Anda kini telah mencipta polisi yang merangkumi peranan tersuai anda serta peranan Penonton.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '14. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "View the access group, and click the Users tab to add a user to this group. This user will now be able to perform the actions in your custom role (as well as the other roles you assigned to the policy).\n"
msgstr "Lihat kumpulan akses, dan klik tab Pengguna untuk menambah pengguna kepada kumpulan ini. Pengguna ini kini akan dapat melakukan tindakan dalam peranan tersuai anda (serta peranan lain yang anda tugaskan kepada polisi).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To learn more, see the [Creating custom roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-custom-roles) and the [What are IAM policies and who can assign them?](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamusermanpol) topics.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut, lihat topik [Mencipta peranan tersuai](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-custom-roles) dan [Apakah polisi IAM dan siapa yang boleh menugaskannya?](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamusermanpol).\n"
